	(text_box "Crystals stabiliy depend on matching a crystal to its load capacitance.\nHere  C_{L} = 10pF, hence the 10 in crystals name.\n\nTypically C_{L} = (C_{1}*C_{2})/(C_{1}+C_{2}) + C_{stray} \nor C_{L} = C/2 + C_{stray} "
